            &none                    &kp Q                   &kp W                 &kp E                   &kp R                   &kp T                                                                                      &kp Y     &kp U                  &kp I                     &kp O                    &kp P                       &kp LBKT
            &kp GRAVE                &kp A                   &kp S                 &ru_d_t                 &kp F                   &kp G                                                                                      &kp H     &kp J                  &kp K                     &kp L                    &kp SEMI                    &kp SQT
            &trans                   &kp Z                   &ru_x_f               &kp C                   &ru_v_r                 &kp B   &trans  &trans  &trans          &trans      &trans  &trans                         &kp N     &kp M                  &kp COMMA                 &kp DOT                  &kp SLASH                   &none
            &magic MAGIC 0           &trans                  &trans                &trans                  &trans                          &trans  &trans  &ru_hr_click    &trans      &trans  &th_no_repeat SYM_RUS SPACE              &trans                 &trans                    &trans                   &trans                      &magic MAGIC 0
